# Shell scripts must keep LF endings. This repo is developed on Windows and its
# CI runs on Linux, and a CRLF in a script breaks the shebang and every command
# in it. Nothing else is pinned here: the rest of the tree is read by tools that
# do not care about endings, and forcing them repo-wide would churn every file.
*.sh text eol=lf

# These recorded JSON artifacts have documented raw SHA-256 checksums. Preserve
# identical bytes on every checkout so portable verification means the same thing.
python/tests/fixtures/live-validation/weight-custody-manifest/paired-2026-08-20/*.json text eol=lf
